{"4620950":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"XENOFLEKT","steam_appid":4620950,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4745920,5127430],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PARRY THE BULLET HELL<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to <strong>parry<\/strong> and <strong>deflect<\/strong> the bullet hell: by dashing <i>into<\/i> the heart of bullets, you turn a death sentence into your weaponry. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>XENOFLEKT <\/strong>is a roguelite space arena shooter where every successful deflected shot <strong>heals<\/strong> <strong>your ship <\/strong>and <strong>converts<\/strong> enemy projectiles into a lethal counter-attack: high risk parries, high reward.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up your <strong>ship<\/strong>, choose <strong>weapons<\/strong>, plug-in unique <strong>satellites<\/strong>, <strong>parry<\/strong> bullets, destroy <strong>waves<\/strong> of foes, conquer <strong>sectors<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/90960aaa2ba5ec65d09a483d5de88071.poster.avif?t=1793642489\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/90960aaa2ba5ec65d09a483d5de88071.webm?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/90960aaa2ba5ec65d09a483d5de88071.mp4?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/70155abcc5ca6c5b79295b1e1bb46e15.poster.avif?t=1793642489\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/70155abcc5ca6c5b79295b1e1bb46e15.webm?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/70155abcc5ca6c5b79295b1e1bb46e15.mp4?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/3fdadb360a515ba874dc0ba78d5a7f08.poster.avif?t=1793642489\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/3fdadb360a515ba874dc0ba78d5a7f08.webm?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/3fdadb360a515ba874dc0ba78d5a7f08.mp4?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PARRYING IS LIFE<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parrying<\/strong> is not only a counter-attack: it's the only way to <strong>heal<\/strong> and <strong>repair<\/strong> your hull. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn every incoming strike into the energy that welds your ship  together.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/a999ca311b8bc567438cfa7fb1467c2d.poster.avif?t=1793642489\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/a999ca311b8bc567438cfa7fb1467c2d.webm?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/a999ca311b8bc567438cfa7fb1467c2d.mp4?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUNDREDS OF DEADLY SYNERGIES<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize<\/strong> your playstyle with three layers of depth. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your starting <strong>Ship hull, <\/strong>add a<strong> Weapon<\/strong>, and equip <strong>Satellites<\/strong> during your run: <strong>hundreds of unique build combinations<\/strong> are there to be discovered.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In<strong> <\/strong>the<strong> Vault,<\/strong> unlock persistent <strong>ships<\/strong>, <strong>weapons<\/strong> and pluggable <strong>satellites<\/strong> with <i>void shards<\/i> gained in your runs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/eb2c42c144a9f7459b9ce845f71b9241.poster.avif?t=1793642489\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/eb2c42c144a9f7459b9ce845f71b9241.webm?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/eb2c42c144a9f7459b9ce845f71b9241.mp4?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plug-in Satellites <\/strong>between one wave and the other to adapt mid-run with modules that redefine your dashes and deflects, improve your movement and your weapons, strengthen your defense, or unlock unique gameplay perks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/5eede283339780114ec09d8c8ec895a6.avif?t=1793642489\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras_big\/5eede283339780114ec09d8c8ec895a6.webp?t=1793642489 width=1560 height=467 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/8e8b073dcef632470c565dfbfb2783c5.avif?t=1793642489\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras_big\/8e8b073dcef632470c565dfbfb2783c5.webp?t=1793642489 width=1560 height=467 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/b94f26b8a212e57809337c57cb0394b3.avif?t=1793642489\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras_big\/b94f26b8a212e57809337c57cb0394b3.webp?t=1793642489 width=1560 height=467 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/696b55cea19700af00a5b86dae133563.avif?t=1793642489\" width=600 height=178 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONQUER THE SECTORS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through increasingly brutal sectors. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exterminate waves, hunt elites for Satellite upgrades, and prepare for dreadful bosses.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet-parry combat:<\/strong> turn enemy's strength against them.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep customization:<\/strong> mix and match for hundreds of build possibilities.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-stakes roguelite:<\/strong> few HPs, permanent unlocks, infinite replayability.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/01f9a86e19392dc7bf7586646dad096e.poster.avif?t=1793642489\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/01f9a86e19392dc7bf7586646dad096e.webm?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/01f9a86e19392dc7bf7586646dad096e.mp4?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INFINITE CHALLENGES<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After having conquered all of the game campaign sectors, get ready for infinite <strong>challenges<\/strong>, <strong>builds<\/strong> and <strong>parries<\/strong> in the <strong>Endless sector<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/44da0f21cb429f540e4debb0fb515056.poster.avif?t=1793642489\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/44da0f21cb429f540e4debb0fb515056.webm?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/44da0f21cb429f540e4debb0fb515056.mp4?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PARRY THE BULLET HELL<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to <strong>parry<\/strong> and <strong>deflect<\/strong> the bullet hell: by dashing <i>into<\/i> the heart of bullets, you turn a death sentence into your weaponry. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>XENOFLEKT <\/strong>is a roguelite space arena shooter where every successful deflected shot <strong>heals<\/strong> <strong>your ship <\/strong>and <strong>converts<\/strong> enemy projectiles into a lethal counter-attack: high risk parries, high reward.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up your <strong>ship<\/strong>, choose <strong>weapons<\/strong>, plug-in unique <strong>satellites<\/strong>, <strong>parry<\/strong> bullets, destroy <strong>waves<\/strong> of foes, conquer <strong>sectors<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/90960aaa2ba5ec65d09a483d5de88071.poster.avif?t=1793642489\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/90960aaa2ba5ec65d09a483d5de88071.webm?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/90960aaa2ba5ec65d09a483d5de88071.mp4?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/70155abcc5ca6c5b79295b1e1bb46e15.poster.avif?t=1793642489\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/70155abcc5ca6c5b79295b1e1bb46e15.webm?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/70155abcc5ca6c5b79295b1e1bb46e15.mp4?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"