reds of unique build combinations<\/strong> are there to be discovered.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In<strong> <\/strong>the<strong> Vault,<\/strong> unlock persistent <strong>ships<\/strong>, <strong>weapons<\/strong> and pluggable <strong>satellites<\/strong> with <i>void shards<\/i> gained in your runs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/eb2c42c144a9f7459b9ce845f71b9241.poster.avif?t=1793642489\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/eb2c42c144a9f7459b9ce845f71b9241.webm?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/eb2c42c144a9f7459b9ce845f71b9241.mp4?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plug-in Satellites <\/strong>between one wave and the other to adapt mid-run with modules that redefine your dashes and deflects, improve your movement and your weapons, strengthen your defense, or unlock unique gameplay perks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/5eede283339780114ec09d8c8ec895a6.avif?t=1793642489\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras_big\/5eede283339780114ec09d8c8ec895a6.webp?t=1793642489 width=1560 height=467 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/8e8b073dcef632470c565dfbfb2783c5.avif?t=1793642489\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras_big\/8e8b073dcef632470c565dfbfb2783c5.webp?t=1793642489 width=1560 height=467 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/b94f26b8a212e57809337c57cb0394b3.avif?t=1793642489\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras_big\/b94f26b8a212e57809337c57cb0394b3.webp?t=1793642489 width=1560 height=467 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/696b55cea19700af00a5b86dae133563.avif?t=1793642489\" width=600 height=178 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONQUER THE SECTORS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through increasingly brutal sectors. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exterminate waves, hunt elites for Satellite upgrades, and prepare for dreadful bosses.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet-parry combat:<\/strong> turn enemy's strength against them.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep customization:<\/strong> mix and match for hundreds of build possibilities.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-stakes roguelite:<\/strong> few HPs, permanent unlocks, infinite replayability.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/01f9a86e19392dc7bf7586646dad096e.poster.avif?t=1793642489\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/01f9a86e19392dc7bf7586646dad096e.webm?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/01f9a86e19392dc7bf7586646dad096e.mp4?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INFINITE CHALLENGES<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After having conquered all of the game campaign sectors, get ready for infinite <strong>challenges<\/strong>, <strong>builds<\/strong> and <strong>parries<\/strong> in the <strong>Endless sector<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/44da0f21cb429f540e4debb0fb515056.poster.avif?t=1793642489\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/44da0f21cb429f540e4debb0fb515056.webm?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/extras\/44da0f21cb429f540e4debb0fb515056.mp4?t=1793642489\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/p>","short_description":"XENOFLEKT is a roguelite space shooter where you will turn enemy bullets into your weapons: dash into enemy fire to parry and deflect shots, heal your ship, trigger devastating counter-attacks. Unlock parts, plug-in unique perks with satellites, and get ready to master hundreds of deadly synergies.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, Italian<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/28a256b97ae80a6f663c48e41a4cb9b2c7a1b53d\/header.jpg?t=1793642489","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/e0a5cb6f110741d9ed982b32b2b99c5ee4b5d707\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793642489","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4620950\/e0a5cb6f110741d9ed982b32b2b99c5ee4b5d707\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793642489","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> 8+<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong>  2.0 GHz+, 32-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong>  ATI Radeon X1300\/NVIDIA GeForce 6600 GT\/Intel HD 3000 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Catoio Software"],"publishers":["Catoio Software"],"demos":[{"appid":4745920,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":499,"final":399,"discount_percent":20,"initial_formatted":"$4.99","final_formatted":"$3.99"},"packages":[1609755],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy XENOFLEKT","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1609755,"percent_savings_text":"-20% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"XENOFLEKT - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$4.99<\/span> $3.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":399}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":67,"description":"Camera Comfort"},{"id":66,"description":"Color Alternatives"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":55,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":56,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":57,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":58,"description":"DualS